grudge-hold-accuser = Some time ago, you found your dorm broken into and your family heirloom missing. You think {$guy} has it.
grudge-hold-accused = Some time ago, you found an item on the floor and picked it up. Finders keepers, as they say.

grudge-hold-accuser-dwarf = This one's in the book! {$guy} stole your clan's heirloom and is playing keeps-away. Show him what it means to be a dwarf!
grudge-hold-accused-dwarf = You found an item in the bar and swiped it clean. No one's given you any lip about it.

grudge-accuser-security = {$guy} creased your nice shoes. Ruin his day.
grudge-accused-security = You've damaged someone's shoes on patrol, but you're not sure exactly who it is.

grudge-accuser-chef = {$guy} stole your signature dish right off the counter. You spent hours on that. Get it back.
grudge-accused-chef = You swiped some food from the kitchen when no one was looking. Someone might have noticed.

grudge-accuser-janitor = Your mop has gone missing. You have a sneaking suspicion {$guy} took it. You need it back.
grudge-accused-janitor = You borrowed a mop and forgot to return it. The janitor probably doesn't care. Probably.

grudge-accuser-doctor = {$guy} walked out of medbay with your personal medkit. That was not theirs.
grudge-accused-doctor = You grabbed a medkit from medbay on your way out. Someone's name was on it, apparently.

grudge-accuser-botanist = {$guy} raided your garden and took your prized produce. You grew that from a seed.
grudge-accused-botanist = You helped yourself to some plants in botany. The botanist seems personally offended.

grudge-accuser-miner = {$guy} swiped your ore bag while you were hauling a load. That was your haul.
grudge-accused-miner = You grabbed an ore bag off the floor in lavaland. You're pretty sure it was abandoned.

grudge-accuser-clown = {$guy} stole your HONK. This is a declaration of war. Get it back.
grudge-accused-clown = You took a bike horn from the clown's bag when they weren't looking. It's very fun to squeeze.

grudge-accuser-bartender = Your personal flask has gone missing and you're fairly sure {$guy} has it. That was a gift.
grudge-accused-bartender = You pocketed a hip flask you found on the bar counter. The bartender seems to want it back.

grudge-accuser-dwarf-honor = The grudge is inscribed! {$guy} owes you a duel-forfeit by clan law. Collect your due.
grudge-accused-dwarf-honor = You lost a duel fair and square and forfeited a keepsake. The other dwarf hasn't forgotten.

grudge-accuser-sec-rivalry = {$guy} filed a false report against you last shift. That goes on your record. Make it known.
grudge-accused-sec-rivalry = You filed a report about a colleague to cover your own mistake. They know it was you.

favor-accuser-doctor = You stabilized {$guy} when they came in critical. They owe you one.
favor-accused-doctor = {$guy} pulled you back from the brink in medbay. You should probably thank them properly.

favor-accuser-chef = You fed {$guy} when they were dead broke and starving. A little gratitude would be nice.
favor-accused-chef = {$guy} gave you a free meal when you had nothing. That kind of thing sticks with you.

favor-accuser-janitor = You cleaned up a biohazard {$guy} left behind without a word. The least they can do is acknowledge it.
favor-accused-janitor = {$guy} silently cleaned up a terrible mess you left. You never thanked them.

favor-accuser-security = You looked another way when {$guy} had some contraband.
favor-accused-security = {$guy} looked the other way when you had some contraband.

